{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Its ridges</b> — like: \"in its rich furrows.\"" "<b>Its wheels</b>. Some say: <b>גדודיה</b> — its [water-]channels, like: \"upon all hands, channels.\" These are plow-furrows; Scripture calls them גדודות. Some say: from the root גדוד. The meaning is concerning the rains, and the meaning is concerning the streams."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 65, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:46.005960323Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}